# CODEOWNERS — required reviewers for matching paths.
#
# When "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled in branch protection,
# any pull request that changes a matching path must be approved by the
# listed owner before it can be merged.
#
# NOTE ON SPACES: GitHub CODEOWNERS treats a space as the delimiter between
# the path pattern and its owners, and provides no way to escape a literal
# space. These folder names contain spaces, so each space is written as `*`
# (which matches any run of non-slash characters). e.g. `Intelligaia*Skills`
# matches the "Intelligaia Skills" directory.

# All Intelligaia skill modules — owned by Neeraj
Intelligaia*Skills/**                              @NeerajDevGit

# CPQ Insight skill — owned exclusively by Neeraj (no third-party edits)
Intelligaia*Skills/Intelligaia*CPQ*Skill/**        @NeerajDevGit
